<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>所有文章 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.166.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-muditp4l</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:18:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/posts/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>学习导读</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/study-guide/</link><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:15:00 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/study-guide/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;欢迎来到观颐斋。这里整理了本博客所有中医经典的学习笔记，按推荐学习顺序排列。点击下方任意条目，即可进入对应的合集，查看该经典的全部文章。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="fixit-docs-navigation"&gt;&#10; &lt;ul class="fixit-docs-outline"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e9%92%88%e7%81%b8%e5%a4%a7%e6%88%90/" title="学习《针灸大成》，掌握经络腧穴与针刺技法，夯实针灸基础。"&gt;针灸大成&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e7%a5%9e%e5%86%9c%e6%9c%ac%e8%8d%89%e7%bb%8f/" title="研读《神农本草经》，熟悉常用中药的性味归经、功效主治与配伍禁忌。"&gt;神农本草经&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%86%85%e7%bb%8f%e7%b4%a0%e9%97%ae/" title="研读《黄帝内经·素问》，建立中医整体观与辨证思维。"&gt;黄帝内经素问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%86%85%e7%bb%8f%e7%81%b5%e6%9e%a2/" title="研读《黄帝内经·灵枢》，深入理解经络腧穴与针刺理论。"&gt;黄帝内经灵枢&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%a4%96%e7%bb%8f/" title="研读《黄帝外经》，拓展中医理论与临床思路。"&gt;黄帝外经 &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e4%bc%a4%e5%af%92%e8%ae%ba/" title="精研《伤寒杂病论》，掌握六经辨证体系，将理论与临床紧密结合。"&gt;伤寒论&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e9%87%91%e5%8c%ae%e8%a6%81%e7%95%a5/" title="研读《金匮要略》，掌握杂病辨证论治的精髓。"&gt;金匮要略&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e7%9f%b3%e5%ae%a4%e7%a7%98%e5%bd%95/" title="研读《石室秘录》，深入理解中医辨证论治的精妙之处。"&gt;石室秘录 &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://acuherb.xyz/collections/%e5%8c%bb%e8%af%9d/" title="记录临证心得与思考，分享中医学习与临床的体悟。"&gt;医话&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="fixit-docs-preview"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;如果你刚接触中医，建议从《针灸大成》或《黄帝内经·素问》开始；如果你已有基础，可以直接跳到《伤寒论》和《金匮要略》。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;学习过程中如果遇到疑问，欢迎在下方留言讨论，也欢迎通过“关于”页面添加我的微信。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黄帝内经灵枢</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu/</guid><description>黄帝内经灵枢</description></item><item><title>黄帝内经素问</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen/</guid><description>黄帝内经素问</description></item><item><title>黄帝外经</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing/</guid><description>黄帝外经</description></item><item><title>金匮要略</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui/</guid><description>金匮要略</description></item><item><title>伤寒论</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghan/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghan/</guid><description>伤寒论</description></item><item><title>神农本草经</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/bencao/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/bencao/</guid><description>神农本草经</description></item><item><title>石室秘录</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shishimilu/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shishimilu/</guid><description>石室秘录</description></item><item><title>医话</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/yihua/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/yihua/</guid><description>医话</description></item><item><title>针灸大成</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu/</guid><description>针灸大成</description></item></channel></rss>